      "missing_expression": "The source player would miss (1) the FORM-SWAP itself as a distinct game-state (you BECOME a demon -- a body/moveset change, GX-02) -- rendered as a self_buff it loses the transformation identity;",
      "proposed_fix_target": null,
      "proposed_fix_type": "new_door_rfc",
      "source_anchor": "The source player would miss (1) the FORM-SWAP itself as a distinct game-state (you BECOME a demon -- a body/moveset change, GX-02) -- rendered as a self_buff it loses the transformation identity; (2) the unbounded Demonflame life-drain ramp -- clamped to hp_cost_scale 0.30, the escalating 'race your own life-loss' tension is capped, losing the run-it-till-you-die brinkmanship; (3) element ambiguity (fire per corpus vs lightning/Spark per attested builds). Form-swap has no engine lane (GX-02 pending) and the drain-ramp is clamped -> APPROX; not GAPPED because a fire-spell self-buff caster with a decaying-HP cost is 'that build, weaker.'"
    }
  ],
